    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to bring to the market this well-presented three-bedroom, semi-detached house in Oakview Village, Oakpark, Tralee.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well proportioned throughout, with the ground floor comprising a spacious living room, kitchen/dining area and additional utility/W.C. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, one of which benefits from an ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a generous enclosed rear garden with patio area, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and family enjoyment.\n\nOakview Village is a popular and well-maintained residential development, conveniently located within walking distance of Tralee Town Centre and a host of local amenities. CBS Primary School, Tralee Sports & Leisure Centre, shops, schools and transport links are all within easy reach.\n\nOffering spacious accommodation in a convenient and established residential location, this property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, families and investment purchasers alike."
      },
